                                "sense_id": "44c049f9-9b2b-3fcf-9d41-075211aca4f6",
                                "text": "\"No — no, work it up and give us the horrible particulars,\" said Jim Webb. ' 'Well, I presume I shall receive all the more sympathy if I illustrate the affair. As I said before, I have a mother-in-law. She is healthy. She is strengthy. She loves me not. She objects to my being out nights; to my being even a member of the Bald-headed Club.\""
