                                "sense_id": "44c049f9-9b2b-3fcf-9d41-075211aca4f6",
                                "text": "And as he heard and as he learned, Yao-tchall grew doubtful of his cause and fearful for his land, and as he grew less strengthy in his manner so grew the Catayans more strengthy in theirs, and as he grew less suresome so grew they more […]"
                            },
