                                "sense_id": "44c049f9-9b2b-3fcf-9d41-075211aca4f6",
                                "text": "His face was completely hidden in the dark and nothing was clear to me except his overbearing policemanship, his massive rearing of wide strengthy flesh, his domination and his unimpeachable reality."
